- **Set $I$ (distribution centers):** S1, S2, S3, S4, S5, S6, S7, S8, S9, S10, S11, S12 (from supply_capacity.csv, column "Unnamed: 0", table_id: file_1_view_0)
- **Set $J$ (customer groups):** C1, C2, C3, C4, C5, C6, C7, C8, C9, C10, C11, C12 (from customer_demand.csv, column "customer", table_id: file_0_view_0)
- **Demand $d_j$:** from customer_demand.csv, column "demand", table_id: file_0_view_0, indexed by "customer"
- **Supply $s_i$:** from supply_capacity.csv, column "supply_capacity", table_id: file_1_view_0, indexed by "Unnamed: 0"
- **Cost $c_{ij}$:** from transportation_costs.csv, table_id: file_2_view_0, rows indexed by "Unnamed: 0" (distribution center), columns by customer group ("C1"..."C12")

